"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"strong\",\"strong-0\",{\"className\":\"font-semibold text-white\",\"children\":\"TL;DR:\"}]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Most robot training data is captured from third-person cameras — but robots act through their own \\\"eyes,\\\" creating a perception–action mismatch that breaks real-world performance. Egocentric first-person datasets align what a model learns with what it sees during execution, making manipulation far more reliable. Scaling first-person data is hard: labeling is expensive, occlusions are common, and contributor diversity is limited. Agentic payment rails — fast, sub-cent, always-on settlement — let machines buy compute, APIs, and data autonomously. The fusion of both: a machine-payable marketplace for real-world egocentric robotics data.\"}],\"\\n\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"Why Third-Person Training Data Fails\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Picture a robot trained to pick up a cup using footage shot from a camera in the corner of the room. The clip looks clean — but the robot will never experience the world from that corner. During deployment, its onboard camera faces a scene it never rehearsed.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"This is the perception–action mismatch, and it is the quiet failure behind many underperforming manipulation systems. Lost contact detail — third-person views obscure the precise hand-object contact points where manipulation succeeds or fails. Distorted depth cues — external perspectives flatten the geometry the robot must reason about. Broken generalization — the model memorizes scenes from a viewpoint it will never occupy.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-1\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"First-Person Data Changes Robot Learning\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Egocentric datasets close the gap by capturing the world exactly as the actor experiences it — head-mounted, wrist-mounted, or robot-mounted cameras recording what the \\\"eyes\\\" actually see while a task unfolds. When training input matches deployment input, perception and action finally align, and manipulation behavior becomes measurably more stable.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The field is scaling fast. Recent landmark datasets include ~10,000 hours of first-person factory footage — a billion-frame industrial corpus with per-worker camera calibration, enabling geometry-aware perception, visual odometry, and 3D learning out of the box. There is 3,600+ hours of everyday activity video — captured across hundreds of participants and countries, powering action understanding and human-object interaction research. Fine-grained kitchen benchmarks include millions of frames labeled with verb–noun action pairs like open fridge and cut apple, with high-detail editions adding recipe steps, gaze, and audio grounded in 3D kitchen replicas. And there is multimodal robot navigation data — synchronized camera, fisheye, and LiDAR streams from crowded, unstructured environments, with over a million 3D bounding-box annotations.\"}],\"\\n\",\"$L2b\",\"\\n\",\"$L2c\",\"\\n\",\"$L2d\",\"\\n\",\"$L2e\",\"\\n\",\"$L2f\",\"\\n\",\"$L30\",\"\\n\",\"$L31\",\"\\n\",\"$L32\",\"\\n\",\"$L33\",\"\\n\",\"$L34\",\"\\n\",\"$L35\",\"\\n\",\"$L36\",\"\\n\",\"$L37\"],\"$L38\"]}]\n29:[\"$\",\"footer\",null,{\"className\":\"border-t border-white/[.08] bg-[#111620] py-12\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mx-auto w-full max-w-[1440px] px-5 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 xl:px-16\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-start\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$Lb\",null,{\"src\":\"/digirobotics/brand/digirobotics-logo.png\",\"alt\":\"DigiRobotics.xyz\",\"width\":210,\"height\":48,\"className\":\"h-auto w-[190px]\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-4 text-[17px] text-white/60\",\"children\":\"Egocentric data for robotics training.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"aria-label\":\"Footer navigation\",\"className\":\"flex max-w-2xl flex-wrap gap-x-7 gap-y-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",\"Contributor\",{\"href\":\"/#contributors\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Contributor\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Marketplace\",{\"href\":\"/#marketplace\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Marketplace\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Custom Data\",{\"href\":\"/#custom-data\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Custom Data\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Capture Gear\",{\"href\":\"/gear\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Capture Gear\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Articles\",{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Articles\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Agent Demo\",{\"href\":\"/agent-demo\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Agent Demo\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",\"Privacy & Terms\",{\"href\":\"/#privacy-note\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Privacy & Terms\"}],\"$L39\"]}]]}],\"$L3a\",\"$L3b\",\"$L3c\"]}]}]\n2b:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-4\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Together these prove the pattern: first-person, well-annotated, sensor-rich data is the substrate of capable embodied AI — and it is becoming the most contested resource in robotics.\"}]\n2c:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-2\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"The Real Gaps Still to Close\"}]\n2d:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-5\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Egocentric data is powerful, but four structural bottlenecks limit it today. Labeling cost — fine-grained, time-aligned action annotations are slow and expensive to produce. Visual noise and occlusion — fast head and hand motion creates blur; the very hands being studied block the objects they manipulate. Hardware inconsistency — wearable rigs vary in alignment, intrinsics, and placement across contributors. Bias and diversity gaps — small contributor pools produce narrow distributions that fail on unseen tasks and environments.\"}]\n2e:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-6\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Closing these gaps demands more than bigger lab budgets. It requires distributed collection at scale — thousands of contributors, verified devices, quality validation, and consent governance — plus a way to price and exchange that data efficiently.\"}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-3\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"When Robots Pay Their Own Way\"}]\n30:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-7\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Simultaneously, the economic layer for autonomous machines is materializing. Agentic payments — transactions initiated and settled by software with no human in the loop — are moving from concept to production infrastructure. HTTP-native payment protocols turn a long-unused web status code into a pay-per-request layer: an agent requests a resource, pays, and receives verified access in one automated loop. High-throughput blockchain rails deliver sub-cent fees and near-instant finality, making high-frequency machine-to-machine transactions economical. Stablecoins provide the value format machines need: globally portable, continuously settling, and programmable. Smart contracts encode who gets paid, when, and why — automating royalties, usage fees, and payouts between services.\"}]\n31:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-8\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Put the two trends together and a new market appears. A robot (or its controlling agent) that needs more egocentric training data for a new task — a new warehouse layout, a new tool, a new climate — could simply pay another machine or human contributor for it, settle in seconds, and keep learning. Data supply meets machine demand, with no checkout page in between.\"}]\n32:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-4\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"How DigiRobotics Is Building the Future\"}]\n33:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-9\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"DigiRobotics is building that intersection. It is creating a stablecoin-native data marketplace — the world's first rail where real-world robotics data is collected, validated, and exchanged through machine-speed, agent-friendly payments. Its egocentric-first collection uses distributed contributor networks capturing authentic first-person work across households, factories, and field environments. Quality and governance are built in — consent, device validation, calibration standards, and labeling pipelines that cut the cost of time-aligned action data. And its agentic commerce readiness means infrastructure designed for the moment when robots buy data, pay for compute, and sell their own task records autonomously.\"}]\n34:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-10\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Robots that see like their operators. Rails that let them transact like economic actors. One platform.\"}]\n35:[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-5\",{\"className\":\"mb-4 mt-6 scroll-mt-24 font-heading text-xl md:text-2xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.03em] text-white\",\"children\":\"Start Building With Us\"}]\n36:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-11\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"The market for machine-readable, first-person physical-world experience is forming now.\"}]\n37:[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-12\",{\"className\":\"my-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-[var(--muted-foreground)]\",\"children\":\"Partner with DigiRobotics to contribute data, integrate your embodied AI stack, or prepare your robotics operation for the agentic commerce economy.\"}]\n38:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-16 border-t border-white/10 pt-8\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L26\",null,{\"href\":\"/blog\",\"className\":\"inline-flex min-h-11 items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/15 px-5 py-3 text-[14px] font-semibold transition hover:border-[var(--primary)] hover:text-[var(--primary)]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$La\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"icon\":\"$1e:props:children:2:props:children:0:props:children:1:props:children:0:props:children:0:props:icon\",\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"size\":16,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],\" Return to the archive\"]}]}]\n39:[\"$\",\"a\",\"Contact Us\",{\"href\":\"mailto:hello@digirobotics.xyz\",\"className\":\"min-h-11 py-3 text-[14px] font-medium text-white/65 relative transition-colors duration-300 ease-out after:absolute after:inset-x-0 after:bottom-1 after:h-px after:origin-left after:scale-x-0 after:bg-[var(--primary)] after:transition-transform after:duration-300 after:ease-out hover:text-[var(--primary)] hover:after:scale-x-100\",\"children\":\"Contact Us\"}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"id\":\"privacy-note\",\"className\":\"mt-10 grid gap-4 border-t border-white/[.08] pt-6 text-[13px] leading-5 text-white/45 sm:grid-cols-[1fr_auto]\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"Privacy and terms notices will be published before campaign enrollment or data collection begins. Contact the team for Phase 1 information.\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"© 2026 DigiRobotics\"}]]}]\n3b:[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-6 flex items-center gap-4 text-white/45\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-white/45 hover:text-white transition-colors\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$La\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"icon\":\"$14:props:children:0:props:children:props:icon\",\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"size\":18,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"#\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"rel\":\"noopener noreferrer\",\"className\":\"text-white/45 hover:text-white transition-colors\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$La\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"icon\":\"$14:props:children:1:props:children:props:icon\",\"className\":\"$undefined\",\"size\":18,\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}]}]]}]\n3c:[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[.12em] text-white/35\",\"children\":\"Agent-compatible payment workflows powered by stablecoins and x402. Phase 1 infrastructure.\"}]\n","/_index":"1:\"$Sreact.fragment\"\n3:I[60203,[\"66609\",\"static/chunks/66609-81fc326aefa2b35a.js\",\"17112\",\"static/chunks/17112-6d02a7878e38f17b.js\",\"96048\",\"static/chunks/96048-94353edf3fef0226.js\",\"37024\",\"static/chunks/37024-473db45fa25438c6.js\",\"7177\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-9ceac550056e754f.js\"],\"ThirdwebSessionProvider\"]\n4:I[35682,[\"66609\",\"static/chunks/66609-81fc326aefa2b35a.js\",\"17112\",\"static/chunks/17112-6d02a7878e38f17b.js\",\"96048\",\"static/chunks/96048-94353edf3fef0226.js\",\"37024\",\"static/chunks/37024-473db45fa25438c6.js\",\"7177\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-9ceac550056e754f.js\"],\"CartProvider\"]\n5:I[76826,[\"66609\",\"static/chunks/66609-81fc326aefa2b35a.js\",\"17112\",\"static/chunks/17112-6d02a7878e38f17b.js\",\"96048\",\"static/chunks/96048-94353edf3fef0226.js\",\"37024\",\"static/chunks/37024-473db45fa25438c6.js\",\"7177\",\"static/chunks/app/layout-9ceac550056e754f.js\"],\"AuthFlowProvider\"]\n6:I[57121,[],\"\"]\n7:I[78007,[\"99489\",\"static/chunks/99489-7b4b74c1a59849db.js\",\"5772\",\"static/chunks/5772-2ad3d6bb0136fa62.js\",\"57304\",\"static/chunks/57304-ca98254065b92130.js\",\"18039\",\"static/chunks/app/error-f0666043f78adcc8.js\"],\"default\"]\n8:I[74581,[],\"\"]\n9:I[57304,[\"99489\",\"static/chunks/99489-7b4b74c1a59849db.js\",\"5772\",\"static/chunks/5772-2ad3d6bb0136fa62.js\",\"57304\",\"static/chunks/57304-ca98254065b92130.js\",\"95953\",\"static/chunks/app/blog/%5Bslug%5D/page-a38ec015cb873e3f.js\"],\"Navbar\"]\na:I[90209,[\"99489\",\"static/chunks/99489-7b4b74c1a59849db.js\",\"5772\",\"static/chunks/5772-2ad3d6bb0136fa62.js\",\"57304\",\"static/chunks/57304-ca98254065b92130.js\",\"95953\",\"static/chunks/app/blog/%5Bslug%5D/page-a38ec015cb873e3f.js\"],\"default\"]\nb:I[38437,[\"99489\",\"static/chunks/99489-7b4b74c1a59849db.js\",\"5772\",\"static/chunks/5772-2ad3d6bb0136fa62.js\",\"57304\",\"static/chunks/57304-ca98254065b92130.js\",\"95953\",\"static/chunks/app/blog/%5Bslug%5D/page-a38ec015cb873e3f.js\"],\"Image\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/css/9b6cbde999f1a60b.css\",\"style\"]\n:HL[\"/_next/static/css/1558ad27e78fe6f2.css\",\"style\"]\n2:[\"$\",\"style\",null,{\"children\":\".reveal { opacity: 1 !important; transform: none !important; }\"}]\n17:X\n0:{\"buildId\":\"YK3G-22n_Yy3cwl6sVn3D\",\"data\":[{\"rsc\":[\"$\",\"$1\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/9b6cbde999f1a60b.css\",\"precedence\":\"nex